# Expo Public environment variables (read automatically by Expo CLI)
# Copy this file to .env and configure the URLs accordingly.

# If using Render or another hosted backend, set these:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://tripguardian-backend.onrender.com/api
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SOCKET_URL=https://tripguardian-backend.onrender.com

# If left empty, the application will fallback to either:
# 1. The hardcoded PROD_RENDER_URL in src/config/environment.ts (if USE_PRODUCTION is true)
# 2. Your local machine's IP (if USE_PRODUCTION is false and running via Expo Go)
# 3. Android Emulator loopback IP (10.0.2.2) or iOS localhost (if USE_PRODUCTION is false)
